      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرِمٌ</span></b>  [part. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرِمَ</span>]. You say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضُ أَرِمَةٌ</span>, meaning <i>Land upon which rain has not fallen for
